# EmailJS Client Configuration
# Get these credentials from your EmailJS dashboard: https://dashboard.emailjs.com/
#
# SETUP INSTRUCTIONS:
# 1. Email Services: Add a new service connecting to Gmail (ankdigitalmedia@gmail.com).
#    Set VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID to this Service ID.
#
# 2. Email Templates: Create a template for project inquiries.
#    - "To Email": Set to ankdigitalmedia@gmail.com (or {{to_email}})
#    - "Reply-To": Set to {{reply_to}} (allows you to reply directly to the visitor)
#    - "Subject": Set to {{subject}} (or "New Project Inquiry — ANK Digital Media")
#    - Content / Body:
#        Name: {{name}}
#        Email: {{email}}
#        Company: {{company}}
#        Service: {{service}}
#        Project Stage: {{projectStage}}
#        Project Details: {{projectDetails}}
#    Set VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID to this Template ID.
#
# 3. Account / API Keys: Copy your Public Key.
#    Set VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY to this Public Key.

VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=
